  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "Hola. Soy Polifacio y me dedico al desarrollo\nde juegos indie.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0048006F006C0061002E00200053006F007900200050006F006C00690066006100630069006F002000790020006D0065002000640065006400690063006F00200061006C0020006400650073006100720072006F006C006C006F000A006400650020006A007500650067006F007300200069006E006400690065002E00100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "En concreto, me especializo en polígonos.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045006E00200063006F006E0063007200650074006F002C0020006D006500200065007300700065006300690061006C0069007A006F00200065006E00200070006F006C00ED0067006F006E006F0073002E00100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sabes de qué te hablo, ¿no?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 520,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053006100620065007300200064006500200071007500E90020007400650020006800610062006C006F002C002000BF006E006F003F00100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿De tu Pokémon?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 584,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF0044006500200074007500200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿De animación 3D?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF0044006500200061006E0069006D00610063006900F3006E002000330044003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "En cierto modo, sí.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 652,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045006E002000630069006500720074006F0020006D006F0064006F002C0020007300ED002E00100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Eso es! Me refería a los polígonos 3D de\nlos gráficos generados por computadora.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 700,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Verás, los personajes que aparecen en tus\nvideojuegos son tridimensionales.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "El proceso para crearlos se denomina modelado\npoligonal.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1032,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045006C002000700072006F006300650073006F00200070006100720061002000630072006500610072006C006F0073002000730065002000640065006E006F006D0069006E00610020006D006F00640065006C00610064006F000A0070006F006C00690067006F006E0061006C002E00100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Consiste en juntar polígonos en un espacio\ntridimensional para crear ciertas formas.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1156,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Cuantos más polígonos uses, más nítido será\nel resultado.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004300750061006E0074006F00730020006D00E1007300200070006F006C00ED0067006F006E006F007300200075007300650073002C0020006D00E100730020006E00ED007400690064006F002000730065007200E1000A0065006C00200072006500730075006C007400610064006F002E00100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Antes, los procesadores no daban abasto para\ngestionar un número elevado de polígonos.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nPor eso los personajes eran tan cuadriculados.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 141
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Con Porygon ocurre algo parecido. Fue creado\ncon base en la tecnología de punta del momento,<U+0010><U+0001>븀\npero la tecnología también evoluciona.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 139
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Me gustaría proponerte algo.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2024,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0065002000670075007300740061007200ED0061002000700072006F0070006F006E006500720074006500200061006C0067006F002E00100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Me cambias tu Porygon por el mío?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2092,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF004D0065002000630061006D006200690061007300200074007500200050006F007200790067006F006E00200070006F007200200065006C0020006D00ED006F003F00100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2172,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Me cambias tu Porygon por el mío?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2184,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF004D0065002000630061006D006200690061007300200074007500200050006F007200790067006F006E00200070006F007200200065006C0020006D00ED006F003F00100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Te lo cambio!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2264,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1005400650020006C006F002000630061006D00620069006F00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mejor no",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2296,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0065006A006F00720020006E006F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Dale, ¿no te superemociona\nintercambiar dos Porygon?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00440061006C0065002C002000BF006E006F0020007400650020007300750070006500720065006D006F00630069006F006E0061000A0069006E00740065007200630061006D006200690061007200200064006F007300200050006F007200790067006F006E003F00100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Venga ese Porygon!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100560065006E00670061002000650073006500200050006F007200790067006F006E002100100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Eh, no seas así! ¡Cámbiame tu Porygon por\nel mío, dale!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100450068002C0020006E006F0020007300650061007300200061007300ED0021002000A1004300E1006D006200690061006D006500200074007500200050006F007200790067006F006E00200070006F0072000A0065006C0020006D00ED006F002C002000640061006C0065002100100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡No, lo que quiero es un Porygon!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004E006F002C0020006C006F0020007100750065002000710075006900650072006F00200065007300200075006E00200050006F007200790067006F006E002100100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Mira! ¡Se está actualizando!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 2680,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004D0069007200610021002000A100530065002000650073007400E1002000610063007400750061006C0069007A0061006E0064006F00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Qué te parece mi sorpresa?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 2740,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF0051007500E900200074006500200070006100720065006300650020006D006900200073006F007200700072006500730061003F00100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "El Porygon que te envié llevaba una Mejora.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 2804,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045006C00200050006F007200790067006F006E002000710075006500200074006500200065006E0076006900E90020006C006C0065007600610062006100200075006E00610020004D0065006A006F00720061002E00100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Y eso hizo que evolucionara a Porygon2.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 2900,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059002000650073006F002000680069007A006F0020007100750065002000650076006F006C007500630069006F006E0061007200610020006100200050006F007200790067006F006E0032002E00100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Viste? Ahora tiene un cuerpo mucho más\ndefinido. Todo eso gracias a las mejoras<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nen la capacidad de procesamiento.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 2988,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 122
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Se trata de una versión actualizada, dotada de\ninteligencia artificial y software nuevo con la idea<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nde que participe en misiones de desarrollo<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nplanetario y similares.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 177
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Aún no logra la autonomía, pero para mí\nese es uno de sus encantos.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 3588,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004100FA006E0020006E006F0020006C006F0067007200610020006C00610020006100750074006F006E006F006D00ED0061002C0020007000650072006F002000700061007200610020006D00ED000A00650073006500200065007300200075006E006F002000640065002000730075007300200065006E00630061006E0074006F0073002E00100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Mira! ¿Y este brillo? ¿No será que...?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 3732,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004D0069007200610021002000BF0059002000650073007400650020006200720069006C006C006F003F002000BF004E006F002000730065007200E10020007100750065002E002E002E003F00100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Así que tú también le habías dado una Mejora\na tu Porygon!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 3820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10041007300ED00200071007500650020007400FA002000740061006D0062006900E9006E0020006C0065002000680061006200ED006100730020006400610064006F00200075006E00610020004D0065006A006F00720061000A006100200074007500200050006F007200790067006F006E002100100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Qué linda sorpresa me llevé yo también!\n¡Gracias por este intercambio tan espectacular!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 3948,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 4136,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Me pregunto si no se podrá mejorar aún más...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 4148,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0065002000700072006500670075006E0074006F0020007300690020006E006F00200073006500200070006F0064007200E10020006D0065006A006F0072006100720020006100FA006E0020006D00E10073002E002E002E00100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
